        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents D05-K650-EMP, Clear Crystal Empire Knob with Oval Revere Beaded Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Empire Knobset with Revere Backplate is a beautiful and elegant latchset that features a cast brass escutcheon plate and a crystal knob. The knob has a modern shape that really elevates the entire knobset into something extraordinary. The Oval Revere Beaded Latchset with Empire Knob is available in a large array of finishes including polished brass and satin nickel. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit doors that are 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available with <a href= \"/products/revere-latchset-brass-accents-d05-k650\"><b>More Knob and Lever Options</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Brass Accents D05-K650-EMP Oval Revere Beaded Latchset with Empire Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Brass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 10-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on one side of the door. It does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of the door. They do not latch and do not lock</b>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. The lock is activated by a push button while turning the inside knob releases the lock. It can be opened from the outside with a small tool.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Empire Knobset with Revere Backplate, Brass Accents D05-K650-EMP",
                "description": "Brass Accents D05-K650-EMP, Empire Knobset with Revere Backplate - The Empire Knobset with Revere Backplate is a beautiful and elegant latchset that features a cast brass escutcheon plate and a crystal knob. The knob has a modern shape that really elevates the entire knobset into something extraordinary. The Oval Revere Beaded Latchset with Empire Knob is available in a large array of finishes including polished brass and satin nickel. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit doors that are 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n",
